            "quote": "Honestly, I was surprised by how good this one is. The quality is impressive, the scent lasts for hours and it's incredibly close to the original. If no one had told me, I never would have noticed a difference. What makes it even better is the price. Getting perfume this good without paying for the luxury brand feels completely fair. Totally worth it, and I'll be ordering again.",
