          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bottle_05_pair_alt.jpg",
            "quote": "I ordered two perfumes and I'm really impressed. The scents are very close to the originals and the quality exceeded my expectations. The service was fast and professional too. I'm very happy with my purchase and I'd happily recommend you to others. Thank you for a fantastic experience.",
