            "image": "shopify://shop_images/bottle_06_desk_closeup.jpg",
            "quote": "I've worn Acqua di Giò for years and this one captures exactly the same fresh ocean feel. Crisp citrus, salty marine notes and a woody base. Honestly, I can't tell the difference. Best part? The price. Now I can finally spray as much as I want without worrying.",
